    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Card Mechanics</strong>: Experience a fresh blend of card strategy and real-time shooting action. Each level challenges you to select a unique combination of attack cards that not only dictate your combat style but also unleash various magical effects, allowing for countless strategies to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325830/extras/c0405a945b2eaa6d1e11449e5da1ad90.avif?t=1731203939\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Dynamic Enemies</strong>: Face a variety of foes ranging from mischievous small creatures to towering bosses, each with their own distinctive abilities and attack patterns. Learn to adapt your tactics in response to the enemy types, leveraging the strengths and weaknesses of your card choices to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325830/extras/6859aca5e51afe776db4cce15956f60f.avif?t=1731203939\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming and Engaging Visual Style</strong>: The game features a vibrant, cartoonish art style that captivates players with its lively characters and enchanting environments. Each monster is uniquely designed, and the animation brings them to life, creating an immersive experience that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325830/extras/4013e387a69d04f6ba3dfb2707bb28c1.avif?t=1731203939\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich and Varied Level Design</strong>: With a multitude of levels, each filled with unique challenges and enemy combinations, <strong>Decks of Deceit</strong> ensures that no two runs are the same. Navigate through different environments, each designed to test your strategic prowess and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325830/extras/7de0873c304ad577de866d579514c93c.avif?t=1731203939\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Elements</strong>: The game incorporates exciting roguelike mechanics, where each playthrough introduces random events, card upgrades, and power-ups that enhance your gameplay experience. This dynamic system encourages experimentation and keeps the gameplay fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Progression System</strong>: As you defeat enemies and complete levels, you will unlock new cards and abilities, allowing you to customize your deck further. This progression keeps players invested and encourages exploration of different strategies as they enhance their magical arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325830/extras/89ff27fb848fc1069f60d040f79879a5.avif?t=1731203939\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
